<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/28/eng@/~cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in paragraph (3)(e), by inserting after the words “appointed by the Minister” the words “on the advice of the Lembaga”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/28/eng@> .
